# Verify with pnpm only

After Cache Components, next-intl, or layout/provider changes, run in order:

1. `pnpm typecheck`
2. `pnpm lint`
3. `pnpm typegen`
4. `pnpm format`
5. `pnpm build`

If `pnpm build` reports `blocking-prerender-dynamic`, use `pnpm exec next build --debug-prerender` for file:line. Apply the bundled recipe in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/01-app/02-guides/migrating-to-cache-components.md`.

Package manager: `pnpm` / `pnpx` only. No `npm`, `npx`, or `curl`.

Session memory: Engram (`mem_save`), not extra `.md` dumps. Persist long-term hardening in `.ai/rules`.
